  "description": "Despite her fiancé's infidelity just weeks before the wedding, Satinne Del Mare is forced to go through with the marriage for the sake of family ties. However, when the event is crashed by an old schoolmate, she accepts his proposal on impulse and marries him instead! After the adrenaline wears off, Satinne realizes something important she hadn't considered. Her new husband is her childhood bully! Did she just make a horrible mistake? Or will this turn out to be the marriage of her dreams? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
